     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Quantity",
     "texto": [
      "**Berapa kilo?** asks how many kilos. Unlike English, Indonesian doesn't add an \"s\" to form the plural: **satu kilo apel** can mean \"one kilo of apples\"."
